---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contactEmail } from '../../site.config.mjs';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use | Zenlingo"
  description="The terms for using Zenlingo lessons, trials and subscriptions."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <section class="page-title">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>

      <h2>Using Zenlingo</h2>
      <p>Zenlingo creates short English lessons from photos you choose. You must sign in with Apple to use full lessons.</p>

      <h2>AI-generated content</h2>
      <p>AI can make mistakes, including incorrect information or answers. Lessons are for learning and are not guaranteed to be accurate. We provide Zenlingo and its lessons "as is". To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses, or for decisions you make based on a lesson, and our total liability for a claim is limited to what you paid for Zenlingo in the 12 months before it. Nothing here limits liability for intent, gross negligence, personal injury, or anything the law does not allow us to limit, including your mandatory consumer rights.</p>

      <h2>Your photos</h2>
      <p>Only upload photos you have the right to use. Do not upload photos that break the law or that you do not have permission to share. Your photos are processed as described in the Privacy Policy.</p>

      <h2>Trials and subscriptions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Both plans, Monthly and Annual, include a 3-day free trial when you are eligible. Apple confirms eligibility.</li>
        <li>Prices and billing periods are shown in the app before you buy. Subscriptions renew automatically unless you cancel in your Apple subscription settings.</li>
        <li>Cancelling does not end access before the current period finishes.</li>
        <li>Full lessons need an active trial or subscription. After access ends, the app is locked until you renew.</li>
        <li>Personal-photo lessons are subject to a usage limit of up to 10 lessons in any 24-hour window. We may change this limit or other usage limits to protect the service and manage cost. We will show the current limit in the app, and we will not apply a lower limit to a billing period you already paid for without telling you first.</li>
        <li>Apple collects payment and handles refunds. Request a refund through Apple at reportaproblem.apple.com. We cannot issue refunds ourselves. Your statutory rights, including any right to withdraw from a purchase where the law gives one, are not affected.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Account deletion</h2>
      <p>You can delete your account in the app. Deletion is permanent. Cancel any Apple subscription separately.</p>

      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p>You can stop using Zenlingo at any time by deleting your account in the app. We may suspend or end your access if you break these terms, upload unlawful content or photos you have no right to use, try to get around usage limits or security, or abuse the service. Where reasonable we will tell you why. If we end a paid subscription without a reason that is your fault, we will refund the unused part through Apple where possible. Sections that by their nature must continue, such as limits on liability, continue after termination.</p>

      <h2>App license</h2>
      <p>Zenlingo is licensed to you under the Apple Standard End User License Agreement (EULA) for licensed applications. These terms apply in addition to it.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Brazil. If you are a consumer, you may also rely on the mandatory consumer-protection laws of the country where you live, and you may bring a claim in the courts of your place of residence. Otherwise, the courts of Brazil have jurisdiction. Apple's Standard License Agreement also applies to your use of the app. Where it conflicts with these terms on matters it covers, Apple's terms prevail. Please contact us first at the address below so we can try to resolve a problem informally.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Operator: Ricardo Gusman Brandão, an individual developer based in Brazil.</p>
      <p><a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
